inada la obra de ampliación.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n   <div class=\"row mb-2\">\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 fw-600 fz-18\">Unifamiliar</h4>\n              <p class=\"mb-0 text-secondary fz-16\">Permisos Papel.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 fw-600 fz-18\">Multifamiliar</h4>\n              <p class=\"mb-0 text-secondary fz-16\">Permisos Papel.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div>      \n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 fw-600 fz-18\">Unifamiliar</h4>\n              <p class=\"mb-0 text-secondary fz-16\">Permisos Digital.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"mb-1 fw-600 fz-18\">Multifamiliar</h4>\n              <p class=\"mb-0 text-secondary fz-16\">Permisos Digital.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div>      \n    </div>\n\n  <!-- /wp:html -->\n\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"mb-0\">Trámites complementarios</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p>Trámites que se deben realizar después de terminada la obra de ampliación.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n   <div class=\"row mb-2\">\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"fz-18\">Solicitud de Cambio de Destino</h4>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"fz-18\">Solicitud de Copia de Plano</h4>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div> \n    </div>\n\n   <div class=\"row border\">\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"fz-18\">Informe de Avance e Inspección</h4>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\">\n          <div class=\"card-tramite d-flex border rounded overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-width: 250px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 24px; background-color: #1BA9E1;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-3\">\n              <h4 class=\"fz-18\">Registro de Profesionales – Obras Particulares</h4>\n            </div>